                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/1400: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Representative of the
                        President</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Corrigan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-03-07T17:00:00-05:00">March 7, 1939—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Your No. 24, March 6, 10 a.m. What do you suggest?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
